	)
	(text "Qwiic pinout: 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL.  2.2k pull-ups: window 967-3541 Ohm, Fast mode, C_b 100 pF (SLVA689A).\nU801 ESD at the connector.  U802 M24C64-R at 0x50: E2..E0 low, WC low = writes enabled (D-031)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 214.63 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6cdff2b3-59d0-51b8-bdf6-0bb8a6d59b0c")
	)
	(text "The firmware's statusLed\n(PlatformImpl, PB0) drives it:\nit stays 1:1 with the\nNUCLEO pin map.\n\nGreen 470 Ohm: ~1.8 mA\n(V_F 2.45 V at 2 mA,\nKT-0603G p.5)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "77dcbd36-9e03-53a5-a7e6-4d1dfe666f5c")
	)
	(text "12 mA per colour, 36 mA per LED at full white: 432 mA for the chain; +5V budget ~570 mA, well inside the TPS62933F (3 A) and L201 (I_sat 3.2 A).\nLED V_IH is 0.55 VDD = 2.75 V at 5 V; a 3.3 V GPIO gives only 0.15 V margin, so U804 (TTL input, 5 V output) drives the chain.\nWS2812 protocol, GRB order, 800 kHz from TIM17 + DMA; reset >= 280 us.  One 100 nF per LED at its VDD pin (C806-C817).  Brightness is a firmware choice."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a85e2b17-e236-5345-8f43-8861cf5d1a41")
	)
	(text "ST25DV04KC: ISO 15693 / NFC Type 5 tag on I2C3 (0x53 user, 0x57 system); V_EH unused; GPO open drain -> PA2 (EXTI2).\nAE801: 10 turns, 25 x 21 mm, 4.25 uH; f0 14.2 MHz with C_TUN 28.5 pF + 1 pF (scripts/nfc_coil.py, docs/nfc.md).\nC804 2.7 pF DNP across AC0-AC1 trims f0 to 13.56 MHz: fit after a phone / VNA check.  Keep metal off the coil."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c745365d-52fb-5018-9ccd-32a1e480fe41")
	)
	(text "Qwiic I2C3 expansion and EEPROM (PB10 SCL, PB11 SDA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ef191d51-d93c-56b0-b4eb-2e610c977d4e")
	)
